        "text": "Originally described as a shaft of about 8m depth, it was probably rediscovered at Easter 2004 and positioned with a GPS. A slot to the side of a shallow, grass-filled, 20m diameter depression is a blind pot with an initial 8m drop and a 4m continuation to a gravel floor."
      }
